# Skeleton Release Notes

> Maintained by the skeleton maintainer. Add a `## X.Y.Z` section at the
> top of this file for every release (newest first). `composer
> skeleton:update` prints the sections newer than the previously
> installed version, so users always see which files changed and what
> changed — without anyone having to edit `skeleton-update.php`.

## 1.2.9

### Changed
- `src/Infrastructure/Core/Monitoring/StructuredLoggingMiddleware.php` —
  `log_level` is now enforced: entries below the configured minimum
  level (`debug` < `info` < `warning` < `error`) are skipped. Entry
  levels are still derived from the HTTP status code.
- `config/common/params-core.php` — the `app/monitoring` params are now
  overridable from `.env`: `app.monitoring.request_id_header`,
  `app.monitoring.logging.{enabled,log_level,include_request_body,include_response_body,max_log_size,exclude_paths}`,
  `app.monitoring.metrics.enabled`, and
  `app.monitoring.error_monitoring.enabled`. All keys are optional and
  fall back to the previous defaults.
- `.env.example` — new "Monitoring & Structured Logging" block with the
  keys above, so fresh projects can tune the monitoring middlewares
  (`StructuredLoggingMiddleware`, `MetricsMiddleware`,
  `ErrorMonitoringMiddleware`, `RequestIdMiddleware`) without touching
  config files.
- `README-SKELETON.md` — new "Environment Configuration" section
  documenting the `app.monitoring.*` keys.

## 1.2.8

### Added
- `scripts/skeleton.readme` — this changelog. `composer skeleton:update`
  prints the sections newer than the previously installed version.
- `scripts/skeleton-update.php` — release-notes display after update
  (`displayReleaseNotes()`, `extractReleaseNotes()`); the restarted
  installer receives the previous version via `SKELETON_PREV_VERSION`
  and `skeleton.readme` is re-synced even when the version is unchanged.

### Changed
- `src/Shared/Core/Query/QueryConditionApplier.php` — `filterByLike()` and
  `orLike()` are now instance methods (no longer static). The `$operator`
  argument is now nullable and auto-resolved from the DB connection
  (`ilike` for PostgreSQL, `like` otherwise). An optional `$db` argument
  was added for multi-database queries.
- `src/Infrastructure/Common/Persistence/Example/ExampleRepository.php`,
  `.../AnotherExample/AnotherExampleRepository.php` — repository examples
  updated to call `QueryConditionApplier` as an injected instance.

### Renamed
- `scripts/generate-module.php` → `scripts/skeleton-generate-module.php`
  — consistent `skeleton-*` naming for skeleton-owned scripts; the
  `composer skeleton:generate-module` command is unchanged. Update any
  direct calls (`php scripts/generate-module.php ...`) to the new path.

## 1.2.7

### Added
- `src/Console/Core/MigrationGuardCommand.php` — `migration-guard` command
  that replaces `migrate:down` and `migrate:redo` in the `prod`
  environment so destructive migrations can never run there.
- `src/Console/` layer with the Core/Common split: `Core/` (frozen),
  `Common/` (project commands), `AGENTS.md`, `!DONT-EDIT-CORE.txt`,
  `!USE-COMMON-FOR-YOUR-CODE`.
- `scripts/skeleton-version.php` — `composer skeleton:version` compares
  the installed skeleton version with the vendor package.

### Changed
- `src/Console/{ => Core}/HelloCommand.php`, `MigrateModuleCommand.php`,
  `SeederCommand.php` — moved into `src/Console/Core/` (namespace
  `App\Console\Core`).
- `config/console/commands.php` — registers `MigrationGuardCommand` for
  `migrate:down`/`migrate:redo` when `Environment::isProd()`.
- `config/common/di/infrastructure-di.php`, `AGENTS.md`,
  `scripts/skeleton-update.php`, `composer.json` scripts.

### Removed
- `.env copy.example` — stray duplicate of the env example file.

## 1.2.6

### Added
- `src/Presentation/` layer — HTTP middleware moved out of `src/Shared`
  into `src/Presentation/Core/Http/Middleware/`: `AccessMiddleware`,
  `CorsMiddleware`, `JwtMiddleware`, `RateLimitMiddleware`,
  `RequestParamsMiddleware`, `SecureHeadersMiddleware`,
  `TrustedHostMiddleware`. `src/Presentation/Core/` is now a protected
  (frozen) path; the installer removes the legacy
  `src/Shared/Core/Middleware/` directory.

### Changed
- `config/common/di/{jwt.php,middleware-di.php}`,
  `config/common/{middleware.php,routes.php,security.php,migration.php}`,
  `config/web/di/application.php` — updated to the new
  `App\Presentation\` namespaces.
- `AGENTS.md` and per-layer rules files — `src/Presentation/Core/` added
  to the protected-paths policy.

## 1.2.5

### Changed
- `src/Infrastructure/Core/Database/ConnectionPool.php` — MySQL/PostgreSQL
  connection pool fixes.
- `scripts/skeleton-generate-module.php` — module generator improvements.
- `src/Console/MigrateModuleCommand.php` — command fixes.
- Documentation refresh across `docs-code/` (value object, migration &
  seeding, setup, localization guides).

---

Versions before 1.2.5 predate this changelog — see `git log` for their
history.
